&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Finishes&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:18.0pt;mso-add-space:
auto;text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:288.0pt;mso-layout-grid-align:
none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;



&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;All new external and internal works and finishes and works
of making good to the retained fabric shall match the existing adjacent work
with regard to the methods used and materials, colour, texture and profile,
unless shown otherwise on the drawings or other documentation hereby approved
or required by any conditions(s) attached to this consent.&lt;br&gt;
REASON: To protect the special architectural or historic interest of the listed
building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Biodiversity Enhancement Plan&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Prior to the commencement of further works, a scale, colour
plan of biodiversity&amp;nbsp; enhancements on the
site, to include the number, specification, and location of enhancements such
as bat and bird boxes, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the
Local Planning Authority. Thereafter, the biodiversity enhancement measures
shall be carried out and retained in accordance with the approved details.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:42.55pt;mso-add-space:auto;
text-align:justify;text-indent:-42.55pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1&quot;&gt;





&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;REASON: This is to ensure the proposed development delivers
an enhancement to biodiversity, specifically for protected species, as set out
in Policy GI3-Biodiversity of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
